{
  "title": "🌟 Universal Workspace Canvas: Full Component & Ecosystem Showcase",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "omni-header-note",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 40,
      "width": 680,
      "height": 260,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "# 🌟 Universal Workspace Canvas: Full Ecosystem Showcase\n### Unified Polymorphic Architecture & Living Multi-Resource Graph\n\nThis authoritative canvas demonstrates the full breadth of interactive viewers seamlessly coexisting in a single JSON Canvas v1.0 spatial board:\n- **Spatial & Visual Modeling**: Interactive Sub-Canvases, RoughJS Excalidraw Sketches, and Live Mermaid SVGs\n- **Computation & Relational Data**: Jupyter Notebooks with LaTeX math & stream outputs, FortuneSheet CSV Grids, and Google Cloud Drive embeds\n- **Scientific Literature & Governance**: Peer-reviewed Research Papers with `ReadToggle`, Streamed PDF Readers, and Schema Dynamic Forms"
    },
    {
      "id": "omni-math-note",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 760,
      "y": 40,
      "width": 560,
      "height": 260,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "### 📐 Mathematical Formulation: Multi-Tier Offloading\nOptimal DAG task assignment across edge-cloud clusters:\n\n$$\\min_{\\mathbf{x}} \\sum_{i=1}^{N} \\left( \\alpha \\cdot T_i^{\\text{latency}}(\\mathbf{x}) + (1-\\alpha) \\cdot E_i^{\\text{energy}}(\\mathbf{x}) \\right)$$\n\n$$\\text{subject to: } \\quad \\sum_{j \\in \\text{tiers}} x_{ij} = 1, \\quad \\text{Memory}(i) \\le M_{\\text{limit}}$$\n\nWhere $\\mathbf{x} \\in \\{0, 1\\}^{N \\times M}$ is the binary offloading matrix."
    },
    {
      "id": "omni-spec-link",
      "type": "link",
      "x": 1360,
      "y": 40,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 260,
      "color": "3",
      "url": "https://jsoncanvas.org/spec/1.0/",
      "label": "Official JSON Canvas v1.0 Standard"
    },
